msgstr "- 保持总结简洁，但包含关键决策、约束和待办事项。\n"

#: src/uagent/core.py:2065
msgid "- Output should be directly usable as a system message."
msgstr "- 输出应能直接用作系统消息。"

#: src/uagent/core.py:2068
