msgstr "- 合并新分块，且不丢失约束、决策或待办事项。\n"

#: src/uagent/core.py:2079
msgid "- Keep the result concise and suitable for a system message."
msgstr "- 保持结果简洁并适用于系统消息。"

#: src/uagent/core.py:2082
msgid "Previous summary:\n"
msgstr "先前的总结:\n"

#: src/uagent/core.py:2084
msgid "New chunk:\n"
msgstr "新分块:\n"

#: src/uagent/core.py:2086
msgid "Update the summary while keeping the prior context intact."
msgstr "在保持先前上下文完整的情况下更新总结。"

#: src/uagent/core.py:2097
